  "worked_solution": "First, we factor out the constants and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3a\\cdot (\\sqrt{2}b\\times 3c) & =18\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 3\\cdot \\sqrt{2}\\cdot 3\\cdot [a\\cdot (b\\times c)] & =18\\sqrt{2} \\\\ a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we swap $c$ and $b$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot (c\\times b) & =-2,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand again we swap $c$ and $a$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c\\cdot (a\\times b) & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
